From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Araceae Runtime <runtime@araceae.invalid>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:20:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Lock spawned subagents to the parent model

Setting [agents] lock_subagent_model = true keeps every spawned subagent on
the parent's model and reasoning effort:

- the v1 and v2 spawn_agent schemas drop `model` and `reasoning_effort`,
  and the v1 description no longer refers to the `model` field
- model and reasoning effort passed to spawn_agent, default_subagent_model,
  default_subagent_reasoning_effort, and role config files are ignored
- the model catalog world-state section is not rendered

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
